  "title": "Cheese Fritters",
  "description": "Whip up these sweet and creamy fritters for your holiday table. Cottage cheese is blended with egg, cream, flour, baking powder, salt, sugar, and nutmeg. Fried by the spoonful and dusted with confectioners&#39; sugar, these are great served with jam.",
